{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":21,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.self_transpose_content_sum_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.self_transpose_content_sum_zero","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L113-L124","doc":"**Self-pair fixed-point property.** A partition equal to its\nown transpose has content sum zero. This is the \"self-dual\"\npartition case (e.g. `(2, 2)`, `(3, 1)`, `(4, 1, 1, 1)` etc.):\nfolding pairs each cell with its transpose, and the\nfixed-point partition sits at the symmetric centre. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.PartitionWithCells.content_sum_plus_transpose_content_sum_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.PartitionWithCells.content_sum_plus_transpose_content_sum_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L84-L111","doc":"**Folding cancellation theorem (sorry-free).** The content sum\nof a partition plus the content sum of its transpose is zero.\n\nThis is the partition-level lift of `Cell.content_plus_transpose_content_eq_zero`:\nevery cell's content cancels with the transpose-image cell's\ncontent, so the two list-sums sum to zero. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:type-b-folded-crystal-combinatorics","label":"prop:type-b-folded-crystal-combinatorics","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/type-b-folded-crystal-combinatorics.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.PartitionWithCells.transpose","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.PartitionWithCells.transpose","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L79-L82","doc":"The **transpose** of a partition: transpose every cell. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.PartitionWithCells.content_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.PartitionWithCells.content_sum","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L75-L77","doc":"The **content sum** of a partition is `Σ_{x ∈ λ} c(x)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.instReprPartitionWithCells.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.instReprPartitionWithCells.repr","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L73-L73","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.instReprPartitionWithCells","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.instReprPartitionWithCells","kind":"instance","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L73-L73","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.PartitionWithCells.cells","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.PartitionWithCells.cells","kind":"def","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L72-L72","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.PartitionWithCells.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.PartitionWithCells.mk","kind":"ctor","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L71-L71","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.PartitionWithCells","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.PartitionWithCells","kind":"structure","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L68-L73","doc":"A **partition with explicit cells** — a `List` of `Cell`s\nrepresenting the Young diagram. (We do not enforce the\npartition shape constraints here; downstream callers can.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.content_plus_transpose_content_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.content_plus_transpose_content_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L56-L66","doc":"**Key lemma:** the content of a cell and the content of its\ntranspose sum to zero. This is the unconditional\ncancellation identity that makes Type-B folding \"work\":\n\n  c(λ) + c(λ^T) = 0  cell-by-cell.\n\nThe proof is direct integer arithmetic. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.Cell.transpose_transpose","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.Cell.transpose_transpose","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L51-L54","doc":"The transpose involution is involutive: `(x.transpose).transpose = x`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.Cell.transpose","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.Cell.transpose","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L48-L49","doc":"The transpose of a cell: swap row and column. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.Cell.content","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.Cell.content","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L45-L46","doc":"Cell content `c(r, col) = col - r ∈ ℤ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.instReprCell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.instReprCell","kind":"instance","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.instReprCell.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.instReprCell.repr","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.instDecidableEqCell.decEq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.instDecidableEqCell.decEq","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.instDecidableEqCell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.instDecidableEqCell","kind":"instance","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.Cell.col","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.Cell.col","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.Cell.row","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.Cell.row","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.Cell.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.Cell.mk","kind":"ctor","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L40-L40","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.Cell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TypeBCrystal.Cell","kind":"structure","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TypeBFoldedCrystalCombinatorics.lean#L37-L43","doc":"A cell of a Young diagram, parameterised by `(row, column)`\nwith both components 0-indexed. The **content** of a cell is\n`c(r, col) := col - r`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}